  "prefLabel": "Csp 402.05 Eligible student",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 402.05 “Eligible student” means “eligible student” as defined in RSA 195-H:11,II namely “a first-year, full-time, Pell Grant-eligible student who meets the eligibility and residency requirements of RSA 195-H:13. \"First-year\" means a student who has never enrolled in an eligible institution”.\n\nSource. #13144, eff 12-9-20 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Csp 400); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
